# Pipeline domain

- Density clustering is time-aware / sequential—**not** DBSCAN. Large-POI pass
  consumes matching pings before the density pass.
- Effective join radius is `join_radius_m + max(ping horizontal accuracy)`.
- Empty polygon rings → infinite distance → never join as candidates.
- Longitude bounding boxes **do not** wrap the antimeridian.
- `Cluster::hour_of_day()` is timezone-naive (`time_s` mod 86400).
- Feature schema is frozen at train time; unknown NAICS maps to UNK; inference
  uses pairwise tournament wins with lowest `PlaceId` on ties.
- `geo` and `spatial` are crate-internal—do not re-export casually; do not
  duplicate haversine / point-in-polygon math.
